<title>HUNGARY: Hungary cuts Jan-July trade deficit to $1.74 bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary cuts Jan-July trade deficit to $1.74 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary reduced its trade deficit in the first seven months of this year to $1.74 billion from $2.09 billion in the January-July period of 1995, the Ministry of Industry and Trade (MIT) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY'S TRADE BALANCE</p>
<p>    ($million)    Jan-July 1996  Jan-June 1996 Jan-July 1995</p>
<p>    Imports	  9,015.4	    7,583.0	  9,004.7</p>
<p>    Exports	  7,270.6	    6,128.8	  6,910.8</p>
<p>    Trade balance -1,744.8	   -1,454.2	 -2,093.9</p>
<p>NOTE - MIT data are based on customs statistics.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 40 40</p>
</text>
